{"name": "Slumber Realm", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"46\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3325390/extras/5a8ec38963e947b733b5136b13c8f213.avif?t=1785367616\" width=\"452\"/></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\" height=\"221\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3325390/extras/59cbc1148a67f023ceb88202af037d90.poster.avif?t=1785367616\" width=\"622\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3325390/extras/59cbc1148a67f023ceb88202af037d90.webm?t=1785367616\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Grab your trusty d6 and journey into a dreamy \u201990s-infused turn-based roguelike. Create wild synergies with loads of unlockable gear and roll for victory in snappy 30-minute runs.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3325390/extras/1d8dcece484e7bbf4d600aabe82785a1.avif?t=1785367616\"/></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\" height=\"221\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3325390/extras/d93e982bd041f9f94e18bb7388cb29b7.poster.avif?t=1785367616\" width=\"622\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3325390/extras/d93e982bd041f9f94e18bb7388cb29b7.webm?t=1785367616\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Craft <strong>degenerate combos</strong> to break the game with <strong>new</strong> <strong>unlocks</strong> every time you wake up.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Four playable classes to conquer your dream foes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Over 150 equipment cards to unlock</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">30 memories to make battles easier\u2026 or weirder</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">60 different snacks to boost your runs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With 30 minute runs, try every combination</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"46\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3325390/extras/42c8541499c7d8e3a2d91f1b7da6e89a.avif?t=1785367616\" width=\"452\"/></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">And decorate it with nostalgic \u201990s memorabilia. Retro video games, rad movie posters, sick skateboards \u2013 everything you need to survive Y2K.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\" height=\"221\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3325390/extras/f378bfb669f23629d2e939643998d1dc.poster.avif?t=1785367616\" width=\"622\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3325390/extras/f378bfb669f23629d2e939643998d1dc.webm?t=1785367616\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"></h2> </div>", "short_desc": "Battle your childhood fears in a 90s-soaked dice roguelike. One die roll triggers your entire build. Chain wild combos, fight broccoli, and decorate your bedroom with nostalgic relics.", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3325390/38b20ceb907272fdb21efde985d146deadcc8daa/header.jpg?t=1785367616", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Dice", "Roguelite", "Turn-Based Combat", "Card Game", "Replay Value", "Deckbuilding"], "developers": "Chugga Ch